  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/tool1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Re-ran both at dev 100b6fbb6e on a 1-file fixture; both exit 1. ctor: 'prefix_receiver_type() takes from 2 to 3 positional arguments but 4 were given' (manager_root added 17da6af2e9). Sanitizer: 'TypeError: _register_sanitizer_callers() got an unexpected keyword argument ambiguous_names', but the direction is reversed from the description: production REMOVED ambiguous_names in 9a23f12923 (09-15) and the instrument's counting_register still forwards it to the real function. MECHANISM: instrument copies a private production signature instead of forwarding *args/**kwargs, so it breaks when production changes the signature in either direction."  # c2a7
